  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 1,
  "question": {
    "text": "Consider the set of all lines <math><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> such that <math><mn>3</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math> Which one of the following statements is true?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Lw0KH",
      "text": "The lines are not concurrent.",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b1MRn",
      "text": "The lines are concurrent at the point  <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> .",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "GWTWt",
      "text": "The lines are all parallel.",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Z6F1m",
      "text": "Each line passes through the origin.",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given condition is <math><mn>3</mn><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>q</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math><br /><br />And given family of line is <math><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />From <math><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> we can say that equation <math><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math> always passes through <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> .<br /><br />Hence all lines are concurrent at <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> .",
    "image": null
  },
